      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{l} \\text {解答 由题易知时刻} t \\text {的速度为} v = \\frac {d}{d t} (50 t - 5 t ^ {2}) = 50 - 10 t , \\text {则} t = 5 , v = 0 , \\text {此时质点达到最大高度} \\\\ s = 50 \\cdot 5 - 5 \\cdot 5 ^ {2} = 125 (\\text {米}), \\text {令} s = 50 t - 5 t ^ {2} = 120 , \\text {解得} t = 4 \\text {或} 6 , \\text {故} v = 10 (m / s) \\text {或} v = - 10 (m / s), \\text {令} \\\\ s = 50 t - 5 t ^ {2} = 0 , \\text {解得} t = 10 , \\text {即该质点10秒后重新落回地面。} \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{l} \\text {解答 由题易知时刻} t \\text {的速度为} v = \\frac {d}{d t} (50 t - 5 t ^ {2}) = 50 - 10 t , \\text {则} t = 5 , v = 0 , \\text {此时质点达到最大高度} \\\\ s = 50 \\cdot 5 - 5 \\cdot 5 ^ {2} = 125 (\\text {米}), \\text {令} s = 50 t - 5 t ^ {2} = 120 , \\text {解得} t = 4 \\text {或} 6 , \\text {故} v = 10 (m / s) \\text {或} v = - 10 (m / s), \\text {令} \\\\ s = 50 t - 5 t ^ {2} = 0 , \\text {解得} t = 10 , \\text {即该质点10秒后重新落回地面。} \\end{array}</div>"
